          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 425,
          "content": "Use native labeled radios and a read-only checklist. Announce a meaningful transition once in a polite status region. Ease a passed icon once for about 150 ms. Stop the Compact arc on success, failure, Cancel, or exit. Reduced motion uses a steady pending mark.",
