              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Use a skip link, navigation and main landmarks, one H1 and a read-only three-row list. Focus the H1 on entry. Tab through the disclosure, eligible retry buttons, Open session details when ready, then Back to Sessions. Decorative icons and read-only rows stay outside tab order. Check the same sequence at 200% zoom and 320 CSS px.",
