                      "fill": "#bbbaa6",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Labels and predictions are matched at 10 Hz. Each behavior is scored independently because cues may overlap. Unusable class frames are excluded from its confusion counts. Whole-feed loss makes every class unusable.",
                      "fontFamily": "Space Grotesk",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
