                      "fill": "#bbbaa6",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Overall coverage uses usable feed time. Class coverage uses observable cue time. Both divide by elapsed time excluding deliberate pauses and including observation-loss pauses.",
