                      "name": "Client grants",
                      "fill": "#bbbaa6",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Read driving data lets a compatible client access approved session summaries, analytics and event details. Author reports lets the client submit drafts for review in RAFIQ. You can revoke each grant independently. Revocation ends the affected access immediately. Revoking authoring can stop a report awaiting publication.",
