                      "fill": "#bbbaa6",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Optional chat uses separate provider-by-provider linking and sharing consent. Chat sends your messages and approved driving context. Revoking chat sharing clears the temporary conversation and suppresses invalidated replies.",
