                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "VlAiw",
                              "name": "Answer",
                              "fill": "#bbbaa6",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "When a required source expires or is deleted, RAFIQ withdraws the report. Review and download access end immediately. You can request a new report from eligible sources through the external agent.",
