          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Frontend behavior · Leave the workspace to clear the query and action draft. Discard late responses after authority or target changes. Start modal focus on its heading, contain Tab, allow Escape before commitment and restore focus to the initiating action or next surviving control. Enter in the code field verifies only. Authenticator recovery exits the action. Announce ordinary updates politely and blocking errors urgently. Static feedback is identical with reduced motion.",
